<item>
            <title>[LU-20824] Received ZFS properties filtered out</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20824</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In &#160;lustre/utils/lsnapshot.c only snapshots that are local is considered in snapshot_list_one.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After doing a ZFS send/recv of an MDT the lustre:* properties are marked as received and will therefore not show be part of the output of &apos;lctl snapshot_list&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is there a reason for this filtering?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
